    card title "Tomorrow I will"

A: How do you talk about tomorrow in Russian?
    draw a_tom a_tom_name

A: I work in a restaurant. Вчера́ я был в рестора́не: yesterday I was there, with был from lesson eighteen.
    draw a_rest s1 g1

A: Сего́дня я в рестора́не: today, with no word at all for am.
    draw s2 g2

B: За́втра я бу́ду в рестора́не: tomorrow I will be in the restaurant.
    draw s3 g3

B: Бу́ду is the new word: I will be, the future of быть, the verb behind был.
    highlight s3 effect underline color #c9871a part бу́ду

A: So never say бу́ду быть: бу́ду already means will be.
    draw bad bad_x

    erase pageA

    draw b_tom b_tom_name b_masha b_masha_name parallel true

B: In lesson eighteen I said вчера́ я была́ на мо́ре: a woman's was ends in а.
    draw b_l1 b_t1 b_m1

B: But for tomorrow, за́втра я бу́ду в Москве́: the same бу́ду as Tom's, for a man and a woman.
    draw b_l2 b_t2 b_m2 b_m2s

    erase pageA2

    draw cal cal_lbl parallel true

A: Instead it changes by person: я бу́ду, ты бу́дешь, он бу́дет, мы бу́дем, вы бу́дете, они́ бу́дут.
    draw v1 v2 v3 v4 v5 v6

    hide table

    draw c1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6 parallel true

B: The endings are those of живу́, у, ёшь, ёт and so on, but t (@highlight c2 effect underline color #c9871a part бу́@)he stress stays on бу, so no ё: бу́дешь, бу́дет.

    erase table_c cal cal_lbl

A: Now put a verb after бу́ду, as it is in the dictionary, and you have the future.
    draw r1 r_slot

    erase r_slot

A: Я бу́ду чита́ть: I will read.
    draw r1b c_book r_gl

    erase r_gl

    draw r2 r2b r3 r3b

B: Ты бу́дешь чита́ть, мы бу́дем чита́ть: only бу́ду changes, and чита́ть stays just as it is.
    highlight r1b r2b r3b effect underline color #c9871a

    erase r1 r1b r2 r2b r3 r3b c_book

B: It works with the verbs you know: я бу́ду рабо́тать.
    draw k1 k1g

A: Мы бу́дем смотре́ть фильм.
    draw k2 k2g

B: Они́ бу́дут жить в Москве́.
    draw k3 k3g

    erase k1 k1g k2 k2g k3 k3g

A: Now listen: Masha asks me about tomorrow.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    erase talk2

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Now all three times, with рабо́тать. Вчера́: я рабо́тал, or for Masha, я рабо́тала.
    draw h1 e1 e1f

B: Сего́дня: я рабо́таю.
    draw h2 e2

A: За́втра: я бу́ду рабо́тать, for both of us.
    draw h3 e3

B: Only the past asks if you're a man or a woman; the future, like the present, goes by person.
    highlight e1 e1f effect underline color #c9871a

    hide board

    icon q_book size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["book","books"] icon_look picture of "open book"

    quiz "Masha talks about tomorrow: За́втра я ___ чита́ть. Which word?" reveal.text "За́втра я бу́ду чита́ть." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Бу́ду: it's tomorrow, and it's я.
        wrong: Is it yesterday or tomorrow, and who is speaking?
        * была́
        + бу́ду
        * бу́дет

    erase q_book question_1_stamp

    icon q_cinema size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["clapper board","film frames"] icon_look picture of cinema

    ask "Type we will: Мы ___ смотре́ть фильм." answer ["будем"] reveal.text "Мы бу́дем смотре́ть фильм." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Бу́дем: the мы form, with ем, as in живём.
        wrong: Start from бу́ду and give it the мы ending.

    erase q_cinema question_2_stamp

    icon q_rest size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["fork and knife","plate"] icon_look picture of "fork and knife with plate"

    quiz "Tom will work tomorrow: Я бу́ду ___ в рестора́не. Which is right?" reveal.text "бу́ду рабо́тать в рестора́не" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Рабо́тать: after бу́ду, the verb stays as it is in the dictionary.
        wrong: Only бу́ду changes; what form does the verb after it take?
        * рабо́таю
        * рабо́тал
        + рабо́тать

    erase q_rest question_3_stamp

    icon q_city size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["city sunset","classical building"] icon_look picture of cityscape

    quiz "Вчера́ Ма́ша была́ в Москве́. За́втра она́ ___ в Ло́ндоне. Which word?" reveal.text "она́ бу́дет в Ло́ндоне" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Бу́дет: for она́, and the future has no а for a woman.
        wrong: It's tomorrow now, and Masha isn't the one speaking.
        + бу́дет
        * была́
        * бу́ду

    erase q_city question_4_stamp

    icon q_family size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["family man woman boy","people holding hands"] icon_look picture of family

    ask "Mum and dad will live in Moscow. Type the missing word: Ма́ма и па́па ___ жить в Москве́." answer ["будут"] reveal.text "они́ бу́дут жить" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Бу́дут: mum and dad are они́, so ут, as in живу́т.
        wrong: Mum and dad together are они́.

    erase q_family question_5_stamp

    show board

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So the future is the easy one: бу́ду with its six endings, then a verb just as it is.
    highlight e3 effect underline color #c9871a

    hide board

    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    dialogue talk3 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Что ты бу́дешь де́лать за́втра?","gloss":"What will you do tomorrow?"},{"by":"a","text":"За́втра я бу́ду говори́ть по-ру́сски! Пока́!","gloss":"Tomorrow I'll speak Russian! Bye!"}] size 1.6

    draw talk3

